    "s": "<p>Skriv \\(f(x)=a(x-2)(x-8)\\).</p><p>\\(4=a\\cdot2\\cdot(-4)=-8a\\Rightarrow a=-1/2\\).</p><p><strong>\\(f(x)=-\\frac12(x-2)(x-8)\\).</strong></p>",
